# Each refusal class names the exact set of ingest refusal codes a batch must
# have carried to be derivable. The class is a machine-checkable fact about
# which rule fired, not a description of how a human recovered a number: a
# batch whose journal row carries any other code had a substance defect and was
# never a measurable review pass.
